  "description": "What does owner B see of A's unresolved and then committed change, through a dynaset opened earlier and through new snapshots? Owner A = Workspaces(0) with DBEngine.OpenDatabase(A, writable); owner B = DBEngine.CreateWorkspace('second', dbUseJet) with its own OpenDatabase(A, writable); one STA. B opens dynaset rsd on SELECT ID, V FROM T ORDER BY ID. A: BeginTrans; UPDATE T SET V = 202 WHERE ID = 2. rsd MoveFirst and read all; new snapshot through B; rsd.Transactions, db.Transactions, db2.Transactions; A CommitTrans; rsd MoveFirst and read all (no requery); new snapshot through B; rsd.Requery and read all; close.",
